000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.
000400     TPOPRTSL.
000500 AUTHOR.
000600     KURT MOVSESIAN.
000800
000900**************************************************************
001000*                                                            *
001100*   T P O P R T S L                                          *
001200*    THIS SUBROUTINE IS THE PO REPRINT SELECTION SCREEN      *
001300*                                                            *
001400**************************************************************
001500*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S           *
001600*         C A L L E D    B Y :                               *
001700*      1. TPURORD                                            *
001800*      2. SPOMOD                                             *
001900*      3. TUDCDOCK
002000**************************************************************
002100*                                                            *
002200*   SUBROUTINES CALLED:                                      *
002300*                           1) TPOPRNT.SOURCE                *
002400*                           2) TSTRMJOB.SOURCE               *
002500*                                                            *
002600**************************************************************
      *C  06/13/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILE PROGRAM TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      *C
      *C  06/17/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ALLOW USER TO SELECT IF NO ESCAPE SEQUENCES ARE PRINTED
      *C   FOR THE PO REPRINT.
      *C
      *C  03/12/97  CA YODER
      *C   SET DEFAULT FOR SCREEN-NO-ESCAPE-PRINT TO "X" IF SWITCH
      *C   IS SET IN MPLTINFO TO PRINT A PO WITH NO ESCAPE SEQUENCES.
      *C
      *C  01/25/00  JE COFFMAN
      *C   REVERSED THE LOGIC ON THE NO ESCAPE PRINT SWITCH:
      *C   THE LOGIC SHOULD CALL TPOPRNT IS THE USER SWITCH IS 'Y'
      *C   AND TPOPRNT2 IS THE USER SWITCH IS 'N'.
      *C
002700
020200
020300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
020400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
020500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
020600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
020700
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DPORECD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT MPLTINFO-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                     ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
020800
020900 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DPORECD-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS  OF MCFLCS0901.

       FD  MPLTINFO-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0501.

021000
021100 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

021200 01  CANCELLED-ORDER-SW      PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
021300     88  CANCELLED-ORDER                VALUE "Y".
021400
021500 01  BATCH-OPTION-SW         PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
021600     88  BATCH-OPTION                   VALUE "Y".
021700
021800
021900 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
022000     05  MSG-TEXT              PIC X(68)    VALUE SPACE.
022100     05  MSG-FLD               PIC X(8)     VALUE SPACE.
022200     05  MSG-FLD-9  REDEFINES  MSG-FLD      PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
022300
022400 01  MESSAGE-BUFLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE 76   COMP-4.
022500
022600 01  MESSAGE-ACTLEN            PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO COMP-4.
022700
022800 01  FIELD-NUMBER              PIC S9(4)    VALUE 1    COMP-4.
022900
       01  SAVE-NOASCII-REPORTS      PIC X.
       01  PLT-ARG                   PIC X(4).
023000
023100*************************************************************
023200**    PARAMETER AREA FOR 'TSHWRDFM'                        **
023300*************************************************************
023400 COPY TSHWRDFM   IN COPYLIB.

       01  SCREEN-BUFFER   PIC X(2000).
023500
023600
023700**************************************************************
023800**************************************************************
