024700         10  PETTY-PO-CHECK        PIC X.
024800         10  PO-NUM-2-7            PIC X(6).
024900     05  SCREEN-RLSE               PIC 9(3).
025000     05  SCREEN-MODIFIED-ORDER     PIC X.
025100     05  SCREEN-CANCELLED-ORDER    PIC X.
