025400         10  SCREEN-ITMS OCCURS 15 TIMES.
025500             15  SCREEN-ITEM           PIC 9(4).
           05  SCREEN-COMMAND-LINE       PIC X(79).
           05  SCREEN-MESSAGE-LINE       PIC X(79).
 25600
